0","kind":"announcement","title":"Secret Files and Lost Horizon Are Back at Animation Arts!","summary":"Secret Files and Lost Horizon Are Back at Animation Arts!We're very happy to announce that the rights to the Secret Files and Lost Horizon series have officially returned to Animation Arts!After all these years, both franchises are finally back with their original developers. This is a very special moment for us, as these games represent not only many years of development work but also countless wonderful memories shared with an amazing adventure gaming community.We would especially like to than","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:51:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040654","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:11:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4504840-1846651706690355","game_id":"steam-4504840","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Here!","summary":"We're excited to announce that the free demo of Secret Files: Tunguska – Remastered is now available on Steam!As part of Steam Next Fest, running from October 19 to 26, 2026, we're inviting you to return to the mysterious world of Secret Files: Tunguska.We know that the original game holds a very special place in the hearts of many players. Naturally, this means that any changes – whether to character models, visuals, or familiar controls and gameplay conventions – are likely to be examined part","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690355","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:29:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4504840-1843481262697436","game_id":"steam-4504840","kind":"announcement","title":"20 Years. 20 Books.","summary":"A quick note for our international community: This giveaway is aimed primarily at our German-speaking fans. The official novel is currently available in German only, and participation is limited to residents of Germany, Austria and Switzerland.Twenty years ago, Nina Kalenkow set out to find her missing father – beginning an adventure that is still with us today.As we announced last week, to celebrate the 20th anniversary of Secret Files: Tunguska, the story has now also been released as an offic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T12:56:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697436","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:29:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4504840-1842846814446535","game_id":"steam-4504840","kind":"update","title":"20 Years of Secret Files: Tunguska – Remaster Update","summary":"Exactly 20 years ago today, Secret Files: Tunguska was first released in Germany.The fact that the game still has so many fans after all these years – and that so many of you are looking forward to Secret Files: Tunguska – Remastered – means a great deal to us.So we’d like to use today’s anniversary to share three pieces of news with you.New Release Window: Q2 2027Let’s start with the news that may sound a little less exciting at first:Secret Files: Tunguska – Remastered will no longer be releas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T13:34:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446535","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:29:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4504840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4504840":"2026-10-26T12:32:16Z"},